DreamButton:GetDragSource {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamButton.h#DreamButton:GetDragSource
    src   "The drag source this button's switch put on the face, or null while the switch is off.\n\nDefined in the .cpp rather than inline, because the class is only forward declared up here and\nunwrapping a TObjectPtr of an incomplete type is not something to leave to a cast's fallback."
    text  "此按钮的开关放在面上的拖拽源；开关关闭时为 null。\n\n定义在 .cpp 中而非内联，因为此处该类只有前向声明，\n而对不完整类型的 TObjectPtr 解包不能交给类型转换的回退处理。"
    state machine
}

DreamButton:IsPressed {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamButton.h#DreamButton:IsPressed
    src   "Whether a pointer is holding this button down right now.\n\nAsked of the behaviour rather than remembered here: the selectable is what the pointer talks\nto, and a second copy of \"is it down\" on the control would be a flag that goes stale the first\ntime a press ends somewhere this control does not hear about."
    text  "指针当前是否正按住此按钮。\n\n这是向行为询问的结果，而非在此处记录：与指针打交道的是可选中对象，\n若在控件上再存一份“是否按下”，一旦某次按压在\n本控件收不到通知的地方结束，这个标志就会过期。"
    state machine
}

