    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamButton.h#DreamButton:SetStyle
    src   "This instance's whole look, replaced and pushed. Whether it is the look in EFFECT is still\nStyleSource's answer -- writing an inline style while the sheet is driving changes nothing you\ncan see, which is why the push runs either way rather than pretending otherwise."
    text  "此实例的整套外观，被替换并推送。它是否实际生效仍取决于\nStyleSource——当样式表在驱动时写入内联样式，看不到任何\n变化，因此无论哪种情况都会推送，而不是假装无事发生。"
    state machine
}

DreamButton:Style {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamButton.h#DreamButton:Style
    src   "This instance's own look. The project sheet wins while StyleSource says so AND a sheet\nactually exists; with no sheet in the project this IS the look in effect -- which is why\nit stays editable instead of being gated on the enum: the old edit condition greyed the\nexact values that were driving the control."
    text  "此实例自身的外观。当 StyleSource 如此指定且确实存在样式表时，\n项目样式表优先；项目中没有任何样式表时，这就是实际生效的外观——因此\n它保持可编辑，而不是由枚举控制：旧的编辑条件恰恰把\n正在驱动控件的那些值置灰了。"
    state machine
}

